From 9bcd2c416497113a78b51c2e2c188c913ae216b8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 12:00:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Added: Show terminal sessions as tabs above the terminal

Add a tab bar above the terminal view that shows the sessions kept by
TermuxService, in addition to the drawer sessions list. Tap a tab to
switch to it, long press for rename and close, and use the close button
or the + button to close or create sessions. Closing a running session
asks first and removes it once its process has exited.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GLNsTPnn2xKUQ4uFcevT6G
